   "ruling": "Ruling: scope; as the prior ruling. Screens scope.other_line16 and scope.credits. i1116 p. 25, Line 20, \"Enter the total of Form 1040, 1040-SR, or 1040-NR, line 16, and Schedule 2 (Form 1040), Part I, line 1z, less any tax included on line 16 from Form 4972\". Form 4972 tax and a Form 8978 amount are refused by scope.other_line16 (which names Form 4972 and a Form 8978 amount), so nothing is subtracted or adjusted on any return the tool completes. Unchanged by the gate round.",
